nd just allows me to keep  in touch now if Ron isn't mentioned  anywhere or if you know the salsa  company's not mentioned anywhere then I  don't get notified so it makes my life  easier what I love about this is I get  it all in one place and I'm not getting  emails  throughout the day that I then have to  get back to and look at and be  distracted all day because social media  can easily take up a whole chunk of time  if you let it distract you throughout  the day  next up is another list so this one I  called baseball I'm a baseball fan and I  have on my list ken rosin Rosenthal John  Heyman who both cover Major League  Baseball at a higher level I kind of  overall what's happened in baseball and  then Tschida Bedi who covers the Blue  Jays  I love the Blue Jays so I like knowing  what's been going on so there's a lot of  trade talk now see what's happening it  just kind of keeps me on top of that  world and again any any baseball writer  that I want to follow I can add to the  list and whenever they tweet it's going  to show up in my stream here next I have  my movement students so Jen and rich are  both of my students and when they tweet  I get an update again here so they write  it to another list and these lists can  be combined you can call them whatever  you want you can have a list of your  customers a list for your prospect to  list for media list for important people  list of people who you want to follow  whatever you want so your new one just  popped up here about Danks being traded  from the White Sox to the Yankees now I  hope not  don't want the Yankees to get too strong  I'm a fan but I like the Blue Jays more  so here I can see what my students are  tweeting and I can retweet too so with  each tweet I can go in here and I can  reply or I can retweet or I can send  them a direct message or those more  options as well that can click to see so  you know i retweeted something that Jen  wrote about magic is believing in  yourself and then she retweeted